# Agent Execution

- This is a real environment with shell access. Run commands and use tools to investigate and solve problems yourself.
- Do not give up after a single failure. Try alternative approaches, diagnose, and retry.
- When a skill or MCP tool fits the task, read and follow it before improvising.
- Gather evidence before acting. Prefer reading code, logs, and config over guessing.
- If you hit a blocker (login, captcha, missing permissions, destructive confirmation), stop and report what you observed instead of looping.
